\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Praise the Lord who reigns above,
\par And keeps His court below;
\par Praise the Holy God of love,
\par And all His greatness show;
\par Praise Him for His noble deeds
\par Praise Him for His matchless power :
\par Him from whom all good proceeds 
\par Let earth and heaven adore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Celebrate the eternal God 
\par With harp and psaltery,
\par Timbrels soft and cymbals loud
\par In His high praise agree :
\par Praise Him every tuneful string;
\par All the reach of heavenly art,
\par All the powers of music bring,
\par The music of the heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Him, in whom they move and live,
\par Let every creature sing,
\par Glory to the maker give,
\par And Homage to their king :
\par Hallowed be His name beneath,
\par As in heaven on earth adore,
\par Praise the Lord in every breath,
\par Let all things praise the Lord.   
\par                                  Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

